{"id":"prisa","lemma":"prisa","pos":"noun","rank":600,"glosses":["hurry, rush, urgency"],"ipa":"/ˈpɾisa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"prisas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-prisa.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál es la prisa?","en":"What's the hurry?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443352","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Tienes prisa en llegar?","en":"Are you in a hurry to get there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152083","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"to arrive, get"}]},{"text":"No tengo prisa en hacer eso.","en":"I'm not in any hurry to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/427919","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"¿A qué viene esa prisa?","en":"What's all the hurry?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/532312","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]},{"text":"No parece que haya prisa.","en":"There seems to be no need to hurry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353391","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"beech, beech tree"},null]}]}